BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 346 Td (The Java Memory Model \(JMM\) defines how threads interact through memory. The Heap is) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 333 Td (segregated into Young Generation \(Eden, Survivor S0, S1\) and Old \(Tenured\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 320 Td (Generation.) Tj ET
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
